  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">GF Malaria Decreased Morbidity and Mortality in Guinea Bissau - GC7 Malaria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The current project of approximately &#x20ac;30 million for three years, funded by the Global Fund Grant Cycle 7 (GC7) is a continuation of previous grants awarded by Global Fund to Fight AIDS, Tuberculosis and Malaria to Guinea Bissau. For 2024-2026, the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) was selected by the Country Coordination Mechanism (CCM) to act as the GC7 grant&#x2019;s principal recipient (PR)</narrative>
  </description>
